<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

32
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you take down Naruto
with her?!</font>

33
00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:14,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was an accident...</font>

34
00:02:15,110 --> 00:02:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Had I not applied the finishing blow
to her at the moment,</font>

35
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we would've been in danger instead.</font>

36
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:22,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know of no instance</font>

37
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the Ninja Art: Kujaku
being defeated up until now...</font>

38
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He will be missed.</font>

39
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:32,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Leaf Shinobi,
your mission is over.</font>

40
00:02:33,250 --> 00:02:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I still haven't taken back the star.</font>

41
00:02:35,380 --> 00:02:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll search for it by ourselves.
Thank you for your help.</font>

42
00:02:51,350 --> 00:02:55,440
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Truth About Why</font>

43
00:02:51,350 --> 00:02:55,440
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the Hoshikage Was Silenced</font>

44
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest easy... I'm not an enemy.</font>

45
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it...
What happened after I fell off the cliff?</font>

46
00:03:48,490 --> 00:03:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be...?
Did you save me, lady?</font>

47
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

48
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.
I don't really remember, though...</font>

49
00:04:09,930 --> 00:04:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well anyway, you saved me! Thanks.</font>

50
00:04:13,310 --> 00:04:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Naruto, a ninja from
the Village Hidden in the Leaves and...</font>

51
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to protect the star, but...</font>

52
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You kind of stole it, lady.</font>

53
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Natsuhi...</font>

54
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhi? What?
I've heard that name before...</font>

55
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That red star's sure pretty.</font>

56
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi...
It watches over me all the time.</font>

57
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same name
as Natsuhiboshi.</font>

58
00:04:52,770 --> 00:04:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I remember right,</font>

59
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru said it's a star
that protects him!</font>

60
00:04:57,810 --> 00:04:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru said that?</font>

61
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:03,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Say, lady,
do you know him?</font>

62
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru is my child.</font>

63
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:12,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! So, you're Sumaru's mom?!</font>

64
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Sumaru escaped?!</font>

65
00:05:22,670 --> 00:05:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am very sorry.</font>

66
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was careless thinking
the muscle relaxants were still in effect.</font>

67
00:05:30,850 --> 00:05:32,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most likely the guys from
the Hidden Leaf</font>

68
00:05:33,020 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are the ones who took him away...</font>

69
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do we do?</font>

70
00:05:35,890 --> 00:05:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be bad news if these circumstances
were to be known</font>

71
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by the Leaf. No,
by those in our village.</font>

72
00:05:41,650 --> 00:05:44,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've got to look high and low
for Sumaru right away.</font>

73
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to get rattled...</font>

74
00:05:47,530 --> 00:05:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can take care of them at
our leisure after we find the star.</font>

75
00:05:51,910 --> 00:05:55,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got it. If we tell the Village Hidden
in the Leaves something like</font>

76
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:57,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they died during the mission...</font>

77
00:05:58,170 --> 00:06:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We could also convince Sumaru.</font>

78
00:06:00,670 --> 00:06:03,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I burned Natsuhi's chakra
into my memory.</font>

79
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:04,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll reach the star</font>

80
00:06:05,050 --> 00:06:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we follow the remnants
of her chakra.</font>

81
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto was...?</font>

82
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:19,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. Along with the Kunoichi
who stole the star.</font>

83
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I didn't see them
in the Valley of Death...</font>

84
00:06:24,570 --> 00:06:26,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying they escaped from
the valley</font>

85
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where the poison gas swirls?</font>

86
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps.</font>

87
00:06:29,950 --> 00:06:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case,</font>

88
00:06:31,410 --> 00:06:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they might have crossed the border
and escaped safely to the forest...</font>

89
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, let's all look for them!</font>

90
00:06:39,290 --> 00:06:41,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the deal, guys?!</font>

91
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto helped all of you,
didn't he?!</font>

92
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if we don't have an order
from Lord Akahoshi... Right?</font>

93
00:06:49,930 --> 00:06:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

94
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:55,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't have time to be waiting
for an order! I'm going!</font>

95
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going...</font>

96
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:04,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go too, if it's to look for Naruto.</font>

97
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura, you can't.</font>

98
00:07:07,530 --> 00:07:09,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to be useful in some way.</font>

99
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I'll go.</font>

100
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru?!</font>

101
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're okay!</font>

102
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We safely rescued him from
the Hoshikage's medical room</font>

103
00:07:26,710 --> 00:07:28,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where he was being held!</font>

104
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Why was he in
Lord Hoshikage's medical room?</font>

105
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't a ninja from
some other village</font>

106
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who knocked you all out
and took Sumaru away!</font>

107
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi, the leader of your village
was the culprit!</font>

108
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:01,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, the Shinobi
who made off with the star</font>

109
00:08:01,370 --> 00:08:04,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the Shinobi who attacked all
of you were different people.</font>

110
00:08:06,090 --> 00:08:09,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what Neji deduced
word for word.</font>

111
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would Lord Akahoshi...?</font>

112
00:08:13,130 --> 00:08:15,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would he do that to us?</font>

113
00:08:15,470 --> 00:08:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does this mean, Sumaru?</font>

114
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know, either!</font>

115
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:23,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it seems Lord Akahoshi
is hiding something from us.</font>

116
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:26,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it about time you guys realized it?</font>

117
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:29,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi's using you as he pleases.</font>

118
00:08:34,860 --> 00:08:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura is not the exception.</font>

119
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you guys continue
training this way,</font>

120
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:41,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">everyone will collapse and then...</font>

121
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

122
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be. That's a lie!</font>

123
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi is not that
kind of person, ever!</font>

124
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:54,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps the Shinobi
who stole the star will tell the truth.</font>

125
00:08:55,470 --> 00:08:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's find the Shinobi who disappeared,
whatever the cost!</font>

126
00:09:00,310 --> 00:09:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The forest in the Land of Bears
is deep.</font>

127
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If only outsiders go,
they'd just get lost.</font>

128
00:09:06,810 --> 00:09:09,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, work with us.</font>

129
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So leave this to me.</font>

130
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

131
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You rest now.</font>

132
00:09:17,490 --> 00:09:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At some point, the time will come
when we'll need your help.</font>

133
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it, Akahoshi...?</font>

134
00:09:58,070 --> 00:10:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were you able to get a lead on
the remnants of Natsuhi's chakra?</font>

135
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is good.</font>

136
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:24,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess this is what's called
good old home cooking.</font>

137
00:10:26,270 --> 00:10:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's more.</font>

138
00:10:29,270 --> 00:10:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more bowl!</font>

139
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why'd you do something like
steal the star, Sumaru's mom?</font>

140
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:43,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not the first and only time
I took that away.</font>

141
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:46,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ten years ago as well...</font>

142
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Training utilizing that star was painful
for many Shinobi at the time</font>

143
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:54,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and even caused many deaths.</font>

144
00:10:56,710 --> 00:11:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My husband Hotarubi and I
who survived the training</font>

145
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">thought to seal the star</font>

146
00:11:07,980 --> 00:11:11,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to prevent any more victims
due to the training.</font>

147
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A tracking unit immediately caught up
with us after we had stolen the star.</font>

148
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

149
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Third Hoshikage...</font>

150
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hotarubi, Natsuhi...
Your thoughts are reasonable...</font>

151
00:12:04,990 --> 00:12:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As it happens, I was also wavering.</font>

152
00:12:07,910 --> 00:12:11,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in the position of Hoshikage,
it was difficult to make a decision.</font>

153
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:15,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise to terminate
the star training.</font>

154
00:12:16,250 --> 00:12:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the hard-line faction
of the Star Village</font>

155
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:20,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">might at some point
resume the training...</font>

156
00:12:21,590 --> 00:12:23,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two must leave this village!</font>

157
00:12:23,510 --> 00:12:26,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to keep an eye on
the village from the outside.</font>

158
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if it seems that the training
will begin once again...</font>

159
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:35,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please stop it with your power.</font>

160
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:37,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Hoshikage...</font>

161
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For Sumaru.</font>

162
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell Sumaru that... we died.
Please be good to him.</font>

163
00:13:06,930 --> 00:13:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I understand.</font>

164
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Upon allowing us to leave the village,</font>

165
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Lord Third Hoshikage completely
prohibited the star training.</font>

166
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:21,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like us, the Third Hoshikage
was also distressed</font>

167
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:25,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at the damage from
the star training.</font>

168
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji was also talking about that.</font>

169
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:30,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But are the effects from
the star that severe?!</font>

170
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. My husband Hotarubi died
due to side effects</font>

171
00:13:34,870 --> 00:13:37,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a while after leaving the village...</font>

172
00:13:38,170 --> 00:13:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might also die at any time
from the effects.</font>

173
00:13:43,710 --> 00:13:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

174
00:13:48,430 --> 00:13:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then let's go back to
the village!</font>

175
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell Akahoshi directly to
stop the training!</font>

176
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi is a man who puts
the prosperity of the village</font>

177
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ahead of the lives of
the children.</font>

178
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:03,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As proof of that,
he has taken Sumaru hostage</font>

179
00:14:03,690 --> 00:14:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and has demanded that
I return the star.</font>

180
00:14:06,490 --> 00:14:10,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Then the masked ninja
from that time was...</font>

181
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:15,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

182
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell!</font>

183
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

184
00:14:22,380 --> 00:14:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was Akahoshi?!</font>

185
00:14:34,970 --> 00:14:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Sumaru's mom?</font>

